From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Wads <victor.laureano@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:51:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Expose explicit DSU full left and right controller roles

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#2429
Reason: Explicitly identify DSU virtual controller halves without inferring from protocol slot or capability model
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1206

---
 dm/host/controllers_mac.m                     |  6 +-
 dm/host/dm_input.h                            |  2 +
 dm/host/hle_dsu.c                             |  8 ++-
 dm/host/hle_hid.c                             | 60 ++++++++++++++-----
 dm/host/tests/t_controllers_mac.m             |  6 ++
 dm/host/tests/t_dsu_network.c                 |  1 +
 dm/host/tests/t_hid.c                         | 31 ++++++++++
 dm/mac/Motion/ConnectionStatus.swift          | 10 ++++
